@startuml
!include ../../_style.puml
title Native picker integration
actor Teacher
participant "Core file picker" as Picker
participant repository_multipicker as Repository
participant "Local catalog / source / policy" as Local
participant "Moodle draft / module save" as Core
Teacher -> Picker : Open related materials
Picker -> Repository : Listing / search filters
Repository -> Local : Authorized content groups
Local --> Repository : Exact permitted origins
Repository --> Picker : Native entries
Teacher -> Picker : Choose origin
Picker -> Repository : Source token / draft copy
Repository -> Local : Live authorization and author policy
Local --> Repository : Source and original declaration
Repository -> Core : Copy native draft
Teacher -> Core : Save editing form
@enduml
